d rock cells (never\nbuild sites, roads, bays or starter footprints); exterior belt of\ncontainers, sheds, silos, pipe racks, floodlights, gate posts, fences\nand boulders beyond the parcel square; flush decals (dust, alleys,\ntire tracks, bay chevrons, oil stains) below road top on non-road cells.\n\nRubble/decals render as 2 InstancedMeshes (setColorAt, zero-scale\nhiding, byte-exact restore); props are static seeded groups with\nuserData.decorative + SCENERY_AUTHORITY, no pick volumes. Dynamic\nhiding via sceneryConflicts in rebuild() only; seed change rebuilds\nscenery and preserves crew. validateSceneryPlan proves checkSite\nTERRAIN/BOUNDS/UNSURVEYED on every covered cell and truck-sweep\nclearance on all initial roads across 7 seeds.\n\n17 new tests (tests/yardScenery.test.mjs): schema authority/budgets +\nnegatives, placement contract vs gridOccupancy, route connectivity,\npaving hide/restore negatives, render budgets, camera-hash guards.\nFull suite 234 pass / 0 fail / 0 skipped; validate + build green.\n\n* test(353): ART-07 production capture script — fresh-save stills, build-ghost TERRAIN negative, chroma proofs, PNG decode stats\n\n* fix(353): terrain-aware build-ghost decal — surfaceTopFor/ghostLift ride above raised rock dressing\n\ndrawGhost placed every slab at hardcoded y=.2/.16/.22; on the new ART-07\nrock cells the wreck/outcrop dressing (tops up to 1.25) buried the ghost,\nand the .4 opacity blend compressed to a ~12-unit R-G shift under ACES\nexposure 1.9 — GREEN_GHOST_NOT_VISIBLE (validRG 0.1) on the graded pad.\n\nGhost slabs now derive each cell's rendered surface top from the same\nscenery plan that builds the meshes (flush decals, rubble y+h/2, prop\nSCENERY scale heights), skip occupancy-hidden dressing, and clear paved\nroads (SCENERY.roadTop) and built machines (schema pick height). Opacity\n.7/.3 keeps the verdict chroma decisive while staying a thin ground decal.\nGate untouched: validRG<0, TERRAIN stamp, machineCount+1, sceneryHidden 0.\n\nRegression: 2 new tests prove the old .2 slab was buried at (19,6), the\nnew slab bottom rides above every raised rock cell, hidden rubble stops\nlifting the ghost, and no hardcoded heights remain in drawGhost.\n\n* fix(353): capture harness collapses compact build sheet via real UX-07 toggle before ground taps\n\n* docs(353): ART-07 yard terrain design doc, manifest, GAPS row + PASS_NUMERIC_ONLY production evidence","timestamp":"2026-11-17T10:16:03Z","author":{"name":"Ryan V. Susman","email":"ryansusman@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1443665513,"node_id":"R_kgDOVgyWaQ","name":"Rustwake","full_name":"darkmatter2222/Rustwake","private":false,"owner":{"login":"darkmatter2222","id":25397045,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mzk3MDQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25397045?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222","html_url":"https://github.com/darkmatter2222","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/darkmatter2222/Rustwake","description":"A mobile-first cyberpunk idle strategy game built with React. Salvage wrecks, refine metals, automate industry, and grow your operation. Developed by an autonomous AI team.","fork":false,"url":"https: